# Explicit upload exclusions for `vercel deploy`.
#
# The CLI uploads the working directory, not a git archive, so gitignored files
# are NOT automatically safe. These three are the ones that must never leave the
# machine, and stating them here rather than relying on .gitignore inference is
# the difference between a policy and a hope.
/secrets
/samples
/data
.env
.env.local
.env*.local

# Not needed for a build
/node_modules
/.next
/.git
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
